><h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><strong>MÔ TẢ SẢN PHẨM </strong></h3><h4 data-path-to-node=\"9\" id=\"p-rc_e85742409cbdb75d-130\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><strong><span class=\"citation-456 citation-end-456\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">1. Giới thiệu chung<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"19\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></h4><p data-path-to-node=\"10\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;\">Khẩu trang chống nắng <strong>6A Mask Gumi 4 lớp cao cấp</strong> là giải pháp bảo vệ sức khỏe toàn diện trước khói bụi, ô nhiễm và tác hại của ánh nắng mặt trời. Sở hữu thiết kế thông minh ôm trọn khuôn mặt kết hợp chất liệu siêu mềm mịn, sản phẩm mang lại cảm giác thoải mái tối đa, không gây hầm bí ngay cả khi đeo trong thời gian dài.</p><h4 data-path-to-node=\"11\" id=\"p-rc_e85742409cbdb75d-131\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><strong><span class=\"citation-455 citation-end-455\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">2. Đặc điểm và ưu điểm nổi bật<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"20\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></h4><ul data-path-to-node=\"12\" style=\"padding-inline-start:32px;font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_e85742409cbdb75d-132\" style=\"\"><strong><span class=\"citation-454 citation-end-454\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Cấu trúc 4 lớp lọc tiên tiến:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"21\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> <span class=\"citation-453 citation-end-453\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Giúp ngăn chặn hiệu quả khói bụi, vi khuẩn, giọt bắn đường hô hấp và các tác nhân gây hại từ môi trường.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"22\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_e85742409cbdb75d-133\" style=\"\"><strong><span class=\"citation-452 citation-end-452\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Khả năng chống nắng tối ưu:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"23\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> <span class=\"citation-451 citation-end-451\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Thiết kế diện tích che chắn rộng, ôm sát đến vùng mang tai, hỗ trợ chống nắng và hạn chế tác động của tia UV khi di chuyển ngoài trời.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"24\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" id=\"p-rc_e85742409cbdb75d-134\" style=\"\"><strong><span class=\"citation-450 citation-end-450\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Chất liệu cao cấp, thân thiện với da:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"25\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> <span class=\"citation-449 citation-end-449\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Sử dụng lớp vải không dệt siêu mềm mịn, không gây kích ứng da, kể cả với làn da nhạy cảm.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"26\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" id=\"p-rc_e85742409cbdb75d-135\" style=\"\"><strong><span class=\"citation-448 citation-end-448\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Thiết kế thông minh, dễ thở:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"27\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> <span class=\"citation-447 citation-end-447\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Thanh nẹp mũi cố định chắc chắn kết hợp quai thun co giãn đàn hồi cao, không gây đau tai và giúp ôm khít khuôn mặt mà vẫn đảm bảo độ thông thoáng, dễ thở.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"28\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul><h4 data-path-to-node=\"13\" id=\"p-rc_e85742409cbdb75d-136\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><strong><span class=\"citation-446 citation-end-446\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">3. Hướng dẫn sử dụng và bảo quản<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"29\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></h4><ul data-path-to-node=\"14\" style=\"padding-inline-start:32px;font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_e85742409cbdb75d-137\" style=\"\"><strong><span class=\"citation-445 citation-end-445\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Cách sử dụng:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"30\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1\" style=\"padding-inline-start:32px;margin-top:0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_e85742409cbdb75d-138\" style=\"\"><span class=\"citation-444 citation-end-444\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Rửa sạch tay trước khi chạm vào khẩu trang.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"31\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_e85742409cbdb75d-139\" style=\"\"><span class=\"citation-443 citation-end-443\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Mở rộng khẩu trang, đeo dây thun qua tai và điều chỉnh thanh nẹp ôm sát sống mũi.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"32\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,2,0\" style=\"\">Kéo mép dưới che kín cằm để đạt hiệu quả bảo vệ tốt nhất.</p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,3,0\" id=\"p-rc_e85742409cbdb75d-140\" style=\"\"><span class=\"citation-442 citation-end-442\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Sản phẩm khuyến nghị sử dụng 1 lần (dùng một lần rồi bỏ vào thùng rác đúng nơi quy định).<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"33\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_e85742409cbdb75d-141\" style=\"\"><strong><span class=\"citation-441 citation-end-441\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Bảo quản:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"34\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1\" style=\"padding-inline-start:32px;margin-top:0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_e85742409cbdb75d-142\" style=\"\"><span class=\"citation-440 citation-end-440\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Để nơi khô ráo, thoáng mát, sạch sẽ.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"35\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_e85742409cbdb75d-143\" style=\"\"><span class=\"citation-439 citation-end-439\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Tránh ánh nắng trực tiếp và nơi có độ ẩm cao.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"36\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></span></p></li></ul></li></ul>",
